[
{ type: install
  message: <<EOM
Set IMMICHFRAME_ADMIN_PASSWORD in %%PREFIX%%/etc/immichframe.env before
the first start. As long as no password is set, /admin hands one to
whoever asks first.

Everything else is configured in that admin interface and kept in
%%DBDIR%%/immichframe.db. The service listens on 127.0.0.1:8080; widen
that with immichframe_urls once a web server with its own authentication
sits in front.
EOM
}
]
